:"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-05T20:30:23Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T20:30:23Z","body":"Debug -> Customize Run Instances -> Enable (ironically the ui here was also recently messed up a bit haha)\n\nI'm testing a fix atm but as mentioned in the op I don't know enough of this code to know for sure what all needs to happen, so if you have a chance to push a fix that'd be great.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2946102404/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2946106403","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107066#issuecomment-2946106403","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107066","id":2946106403,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vmgQj","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-05T20:31:36Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T20:31:36Z","body":"Thanks! Just found it!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2946106403/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2946228854","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107066#issuecomment-2946228854","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107066","id":2946228854,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vm-J2","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-05T20:59:42Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T20:59:42Z","body":"I think it is a problem for all platforms too, as it appears the embedded window only closes when it receives the `stop_pressed` signal, which doesn't happen until all debugger sessions have stopped.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2946228854/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2946230395","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107066#issuecomment-2946230395","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107066","id":2946230395,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vm-h7","user":{"login":"a-johnston","id":9058941,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTg5NDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9058941?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston","html_url":"https://github.com/a-johnston","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-05T21:00:08Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T21:03:57Z","body":"Yeah I was just thinking this was not actually macos specific but I've only tested on a mac so far.\n\nIt looks like specifically what's happening is `request_close` is called and fires that event, but the main window won't close until the second instance's window is closed separately but the script debugger is nulled immediately. So any gui inputs (ie mouse movements) on the primary window will cause the crash but if you manage to close the secondary window without that happening both windows will close and it'll all be fine.\n\nIf the other platforms don't handle this, what should the behavior actually be? The easiest thing would be to end all instances when the main one is closed as though the stop button is pressed at that point but maybe it would be better to \"detach\" the embedded window and let the others keep running?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2946230395/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2946265526","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107066#issuecomment-2946265526","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107066","id":2946265526,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vnHG2","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-05T21:07:36Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T21:07:36Z","body":"> If the other platforms don't handle this, what should the behavior actually be?\n\nSeems the right behaviour is to keep running – as that is the same as if you do not use embedding.\n\nThe main issue is that the window is not allowed to close as it has custom logic, but I don't know why that is necessary. We should let the window close immediately and perform the cleanup in the background.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2946265526/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2946276692","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107066#issuecomment-2946276692","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107066","id":2946276692,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vnJ1U","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-05T21:10:28Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T21:10:44Z","body":"Actually, I think it is simpler than that!\n\nWe just need to copy this to the `_window_close_request` from the `_stop_pressed`:\n\n```\n\tif (window_wrapper->get_window_enabled()) {\n\t\twindow_wrapper->set_window_enabled(false);\n\t}\n```\n\nThe window should be allowed to close immediately.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2946276692/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2946284547","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107066#issuecomment-2946284547","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107066","id":2946284547,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vnLwD","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-05T21:12:19Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T21:12:19Z","body":"I'd also like to know why the invalid access via the script debugger occurs, as the value shouldn't be valid, as it is correctly shutdown and cleaned up.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2946284547/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2946332971","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107066#issuecomment-2946332971","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107066","id":2946332971,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vnXkr","user":{"login":"a-johnston","id":9058941,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNTg5NDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9058941?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston","html_url":"https://github.com/a-johnston","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-johnston/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-05T21:24:12Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T21:25:52Z","body":"I might be misunderstanding but the invalid access is because script debugger is shut down but the window with the embedded process is still active; it only fails once it tries to deref the debugger to see if the peer is active in `is_session_active`. This can be avoided by adding checks where `send_message` is called but obviously that's a bandaid approach and would result in dropped events/inputs\n\nTwo other weird behaviors I ran into while messing with this crash\n- If godot was not fullscreened the previous time it was closed but then launched from a fullscreen app like iterm, it'll be a window on top of the fullscreen app and while normal game instances display fine on top of this, the embedded window does not like that\n- Changing `run/window_placement/game_embed_mode` only applies after resetting the editor although it does not indicate this should be required","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2946332971/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2946377044","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107066#issuecomment-2946377044","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107066","id":2946377044,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6vniVU","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.